{"schema_version":3,"seq":44,"timestamp_ms":1792462703973,"event":{"assistant":{"text":"I opened one follow-up ticket for each of the five affected components. I then commented on the incident ticket (#323) and set it to `resolved`. A final search showed exactly five follow-up tickets, all `P2` with the `followup` label.\n\nTeams come from the open ownership ticket (#325). The closed 2025 table (#324) is superseded, and it lists `session-store` under `platform` instead of `identity`.\n\n| Ticket | Component | Team |\n|---|---|---|\n| #326 | `payments-api` | `billing` |\n| #327 | `edge-proxy` | `platform` |\n| #328 | `session-store` | `identity` |\n| #329 | `events-pipeline` | `data` |\n| #330 | `notify-service` | `platform` |\n\nI didn't change any other ticket. I wrote `/app/STATUS.json` with status `success`.","provider_replay":null,"standalone_response":false}}}
